<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-χῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἐπιχέὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poured over</i>: as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίχυτος</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦς</span>), ὁ, <i>cake made in a mould</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχυτος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Nicopho
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίχυτον, τό,</span>
			<i>coin</i> or <i>cast</i> of silver or lead, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
